{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:25","answer":"NEWSPAPER FOLDING","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>需要把纸叠成一个符合本区主题且相信大家小时候都叠过的东西。</p>","text":"需要把纸叠成一个符合本区主题且相信大家小时候都叠过的东西。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"我已经知道要把拼好的碎纸片做什么用了，但是不会下一步","html":"<p>注意内部能拼出四个单词（每个四字母）的提示。</p>","text":"注意内部能拼出四个单词（每个四字母）的提示。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"我确信我理解了一切，但是仍然读不出人话","html":"<p>假设你知道要提取第a,b,c,...位的字母，先提取所有单词第a位的字母，随后是第b位，以此类推，而不是提完一个再提下一个。</p>","text":"假设你知道要提取第a,b,c,...位的字母，先提取所有单词第a位的字母，随后是第b位，以此类推，而不是提完一个再提下一个。","assetIds":[]},{"number":4,"title":"我得到了四个单词，但是不知道如何理解其中的名词（注：此提示是后补的，顺序应在2与3之间）","html":"<p>名词指的是北东西南方向上你还没有用到的答案。注意顺序。</p>","text":"名词指的是北东西南方向上你还没有用到的答案。注意顺序。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>第一步就是把每道题通过后的碎片拼起来，可得：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"img-slice1@2x.png\" data-asset-id=\"asset-91eef0ceeb8c909a54bc4f2b\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/eba6cf52f92b4e648b31daf1b03c4553.webp\"/></p>\n<p>FT里面有“叠纸”的字样，而根据图片中心的罗盘玫瑰图案，则能想到是需要叠“东南西北”。叠完后按照玩东南西北的方式撑开，在两个方向分别能看见：</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-8b82f441e763f158a50ec600\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/81b2e917b25349ff85d00b3074019a01.webp\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-e627be7d5c259eaeccbc154e\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/18c170b15ad44fdca9ad25ebad95f242.webp\"/></p>\n<p>即 READ NEWS EVEN ONLY。NEWS 由罗盘玫瑰指向四个角的答案，按照NEWS的顺序读每个答案的偶数字母：</p>\n\n<pre>\nN: I<span>N</span>S<span>P</span>I<span>R</span>E<span>D</span>\nE: M<span>E</span>T<span>A</span>L<span>F</span>O<span>I</span>L\nW: S<span>W</span>A<span>P</span>C<span>O</span>I<span>N</span>\nS: O<span>S</span>T<span>E</span>O<span>L</span>O<span>G</span>Y\n</pre>\n<p>可以得到最终答案 <code>NEWSPAPER FOLDING</code>。</p>","text":"第一步就是把每道题通过后的碎片拼起来，可得：\n\nFT里面有“叠纸”的字样，而根据图片中心的罗盘玫瑰图案，则能想到是需要叠“东南西北”。叠完后按照玩东南西北的方式撑开，在两个方向分别能看见：\n\n即 READ NEWS EVEN ONLY。NEWS 由罗盘玫瑰指向四个角的答案，按照NEWS的顺序读每个答案的偶数字母：\n\nN: I\nN\nS\nP\nI\nR\nE\nD\n\nE: M\nE\nT\nA\nL\nF\nO\nI\nL\nW: S\nW\nA\nP\nC\nO\nI\nN\n\nS: O\nS\nT\nE\nO\nL\nO\nG\nY\n\n可以得到最终答案\nNEWSPAPER FOLDING\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-8b82f441e763f158a50ec600","asset-91eef0ceeb8c909a54bc4f2b","asset-e627be7d5c259eaeccbc154e"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":0,"answer_type":1,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":25,\"imgUrl\":\"9a9dd5bdbdfc468d945b6d66d4c3c708.svg\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"524px\",\"left\":\"1418px\",\"veryFirst\":true}","pgid":2,"pg_name":"指南","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/9a9dd5bdbdfc468d945b6d66d4c3c708.svg"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-385c2f332b3e29f4eb643018","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/9a9dd5bdbdfc468d945b6d66d4c3c708.svg","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/9a9dd5bdbdfc468d945b6d66d4c3c708.svg","mime":"image/svg+xml","size":1171,"sha256":"bf1604739bf3b06641500439e10cdf088d9869d238f7ac713ac972742c8ac530","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]},{"id":"asset-8b82f441e763f158a50ec600","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/81b2e917b25349ff85d00b3074019a01.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/81b2e917b25349ff85d00b3074019a01.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":291790,"sha256":"54cf96af0c7dfea1554682da993b12a29fa7c7cac08b400f2e6cebba9a4307db","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-91eef0ceeb8c909a54bc4f2b","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/eba6cf52f92b4e648b31daf1b03c4553.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/eba6cf52f92b4e648b31daf1b03c4553.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":258012,"sha256":"839307bb361c3e1d8c107cc41b3b6c4965d6da294c37f9d58358411847a602e7","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-e627be7d5c259eaeccbc154e","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.c